WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.093 --> 00:00:05.038
Daisy and Kaleem were on their way to their friend Grace's house.

2
00:00:05.039 --> 00:00:08.086
Beatrice was sitting on Daisy's headband.

3
00:00:08.087 --> 00:00:13.065
"Mrs. Ortiz has been in the hospital for a long time," Kaleem said.

4
00:00:13.066 --> 00:00:15.682
"I hope she's going to be okay."

5
00:00:15.683 --> 00:00:18.579
"Me too," Daisy said.

6
00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:22.660
"I'm glad you're helping that dog, Daisy," Beatrice said.

7
00:00:22.661 --> 00:00:26.351
"I'm sure it makes that poor old lady feel better."

8
00:00:26.352 --> 00:00:29.538
"I hope so," Daisy said.

9
00:00:29.539 --> 00:00:31.742
"Me too," Beatrice said.

10
00:00:31.743 --> 00:00:37.456
"Because it's almost time for me to report to the council—Oops, never mind!"

11
00:00:37.457 --> 00:00:40.539
"Huh?" Daisy was confused.

12
00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:43.841
She wanted to ask Beatrice what she was talking about.

13
00:00:43.842 --> 00:00:47.601
But just then Grace hurried toward them.

14
00:00:47.602 --> 00:00:57.288
"Hi, you guys! Let's go see Scamp!"

15
00:00:57.289 --> 00:01:02.303
Soon the three kids were letting Scamp out of the house.

16
00:01:02.304 --> 00:01:05.738
He ran to his pool and leaped in.

17
00:01:05.739 --> 00:01:10.255
Water splashed everywhere.

18
00:01:10.256 --> 00:01:17.118
Beatrice buzzed as the water drenched her. "Ugh! I hate water!"

19
00:01:17.119 --> 00:01:22.672
Grace looked at Daisy. "Is that a bee on your headband, Daisy?"

20
00:01:22.673 --> 00:01:25.573
"It's a pin," Daisy said quickly.

21
00:01:25.574 --> 00:01:29.975
She didn't like lying to Grace. But what else could she do?

22
00:01:29.976 --> 00:01:35.595
"Oh," Grace said, peering at it. "It looks so real.

23
00:01:35.596 --> 00:01:40.398
You probably know this already—bumblebees have five eyes."

24
00:01:40.399 --> 00:01:44.256
Daisy nodded. "Bumblebees are really cool."

25
00:01:44.257 --> 00:01:47.823
"Bzzz!"

26
00:01:47.824 --> 00:01:53.692
Daisy hurried over to Kaleem before Grace noticed anything strange about her "pin."

27
00:01:53.693 --> 00:01:56.538
Kaleem was tossing a ball for Scamp to fetch.

28
00:01:56.539 --> 00:02:00.988
The dog splashed through the pool each time he ran after it.

29
00:02:00.989 --> 00:02:06.340
Daisy smiled. "You're splashing all the water out of your pool, Scamp!"

30
00:02:06.341 --> 00:02:12.338
"I can't help it," Scamp said. "I love playing in the water!"

31
00:02:12.339 --> 00:02:16.241
The back door of Mrs. Ortiz's house suddenly opened.

32
00:02:16.242 --> 00:02:19.953
A man with dark hair came out and waved to Grace.

33
00:02:19.954 --> 00:02:25.257
"Hello, Grace! Do you remember me? I'm Mrs. Ortiz's son, Philip."

34
00:02:25.258 --> 00:02:27.819
"Hi," Grace said softly.

35
00:02:27.820 --> 00:02:30.153
Scamp ran over to the man.

36
00:02:30.154 --> 00:02:34.724
"Hi, Philip!" He barked happily.

37
00:02:34.725 --> 00:02:39.481
"You came to visit me today! Where are Alex and Olivia?"

38
00:02:39.482 --> 00:02:46.629
Daisy wanted to ask who Alex and Olivia were. But that would give away her secret, of course.

39
00:02:46.630 --> 00:02:50.759
"How is Mrs. Ortiz doing?" Kaleem asked.

40
00:02:50.760 --> 00:02:54.810
"She's feeling much better, thanks." Philip smiled.

41
00:02:54.811 --> 00:02:59.289
"But our family has discussed the situation, and we've made a big decision.

42
00:02:59.290 --> 00:03:02.212
My mother shouldn't live here alone anymore.

43
00:03:02.213 --> 00:03:04.568
She's going to move in with me and my wife.

44
00:03:04.569 --> 00:03:08.545
Our kids, Alex and Olivia, are excited to have their grandma live with us.

45
00:03:08.546 --> 00:03:11.841
Luckily we have a spare bedroom in our condo."

46
00:03:11.842 --> 00:03:16.350
"Oh, that sounds wonderful," Daisy said.

47
00:03:16.351 --> 00:03:19.989
"Yes," Grace said softly, looking down.

48
00:03:19.990 --> 00:03:26.819
"But I'll miss having Mrs. Ortiz and Scamp living next door to us."

49
00:03:26.820 --> 00:03:33.043
"I'll miss Grace too!" Scamp barked.

50
00:03:33.044 --> 00:03:35.828
"And I'll miss my yard and my pool.

51
00:03:35.829 --> 00:03:41.603
But I love Alex and Olivia! We'll have fun all the time!"

52
00:03:41.604 --> 00:03:46.611
Daisy smiled and winked at the dog. Then she looked up at Philip.

53
00:03:46.612 --> 00:03:50.203
"I bet Scamp will love living with you and your kids."

54
00:03:50.204 --> 00:03:54.955
Philip shook his head. "Actually, Scamp won't be moving in with us.

55
00:03:54.956 --> 00:03:59.669
Our condo complex doesn't allow dogs." He shrugged.

56
00:03:59.670 --> 00:04:07.922
"It's a shame, but we'll have to find Scamp another home."

